WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.840
Hello, champ! Welcome back

2
00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:23.030
Ch 1: Input · Process · Output  ·  Ch 2: Binary

3
00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:30.020
Chapter 3 · Input & Output Devices

4
00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:38.960
Say with me: Input & Output Devices

5
00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:45.370
Let's meet real devices!

6
00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:55.260
A closed box… no keyboard, no screen

7
00:00:55.260 --> 00:01:03.090
How do we tell it? How does it answer?

8
00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:08.730
Your turn — think!

9
00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:18.260
It needs an IN door and an OUT door

10
00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:22.800
Doors = devices

11
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:27.290
INPUT devices → bring information IN

12
00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:32.840
OUTPUT devices → send information OUT

13
00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:44.680
Input devices · Process · Output devices

14
00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:51.690
Say: IN comes in · OUT goes out!

15
00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:58.560
Meet the INPUT devices

16
00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:08.240
Keyboard → you type → INPUT

17
00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:18.520
Mouse → point & click → INPUT

18
00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:27.190
Microphone → listens → INPUT

19
00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:35.950
Camera → takes pictures → INPUT

20
00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:42.670
4 input devices: all bring information IN

21
00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:48.990
Meet the OUTPUT devices

22
00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:55.350
Screen → shows pictures → OUTPUT

23
00:02:55.350 --> 00:03:01.230
Speaker → plays sound → OUTPUT

24
00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:07.790
Printer → prints on paper → OUTPUT

25
00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:13.990
3 output devices: all send information OUT

26
00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:23.140
Tricky: mic and speaker both use sound!

27
00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:30.560
Microphone listens → takes IN → INPUT

28
00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:37.910
Speaker talks → gives OUT → OUTPUT

29
00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:50.150
TAKES from me → INPUT · GIVES to me → OUTPUT

30
00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:57.380
Say: Takes = input · Gives = output!

31
00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:05.330
Some devices are extra clever…

32
00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:11.930
You tap → your touch goes IN

33
00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:18.320
Screen shows pictures → OUT

34
00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:23.530
Touchscreen = BOTH input and output

35
00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:32.030
Headset: mic IN + earphones OUT

36
00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:41.030
Sorting game — shout your answer!

37
00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:46.080
Keyboard — input or output?

38
00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:50.740
Keyboard → INPUT

39
00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:55.740
Screen — input or output?

40
00:04:55.740 --> 00:05:00.260
Screen → OUTPUT

41
00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:05.530
Microphone — input or output?

42
00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:10.050
Microphone → INPUT

43
00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:14.980
Printer — input or output?

44
00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:19.180
Printer → OUTPUT

45
00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:24.140
Camera — input or output?

46
00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:28.490
Camera → INPUT

47
00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:33.590
Speaker — input or output?

48
00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:38.350
Speaker → OUTPUT

49
00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:44.950
Touchscreen — careful!

50
00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:50.550
Touchscreen → BOTH

51
00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:56.700
Big clap for you, champ!

52
00:05:56.700 --> 00:06:03.110
Story: a video call with Nani

53
00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:12.040
Camera + microphone → your face & voice go IN

54
00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:17.680
Computers process and send it across

55
00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:26.230
Nani's screen + speaker → OUTPUT

56
00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:35.790
Same trip back: input → process → output

57
00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:42.080
Device detective — look around you!

58
00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:53.870
Find 1 INPUT + 1 OUTPUT

59
00:06:53.870 --> 00:07:06.280
Remote → INPUT · TV screen → OUTPUT

60
00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:09.910
Great detective work!

61
00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:15.070
Practice check

62
00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:21.330
Speaker: INPUT or OUTPUT?

63
00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:27.870
Trick: takes from you, or gives to you?

64
00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:34.550
Answer: OUTPUT — it gives sound to you

65
00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:44.060
INPUT: keyboard · mouse · mic · camera

66
00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:50.450
OUTPUT: screen · speaker · printer

67
00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:55.420
BOTH: touchscreen

68
00:07:55.420 --> 00:08:02.340
Takes → input · Gives → output

69
00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:09.860
Chapter 3 complete!

70
00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:18.960
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
